---
description: Keep pull request comments as drafts for user approval
alwaysApply: true
---

# Draft Pull Request Comments Only

- Never publish, submit, or reply to pull request comments directly.
- For line comments, create a pending review, add draft comments to it, and leave the review pending for the user to finalize.
- Never submit a pending review.
- If GitHub does not support a draft for the comment type, provide the proposed text in chat instead of posting it.
